  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My friend say how to make it locally. I noticed it's just missing there.\nThe manual says clearly there is parameter for \"Synchronize Physics\"\nI know it's inside Udon Behaviour before UnU came (i think) but it's removed.\nSee here: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrc_objectsync\n\nSo according the manual, there should two toggles. Only transfer is there, but no physics toggle.\n\nThis is kinda problem, because not in every world the pickup must synced to others (like personal control board) and that is a problem. Please add missing toggle, i cannot find other ways to turn it off and make it local.\n\nBetter fix it ASAP. Some worlds will other way have problem with it. Because it's by default enabled.\n\nEdit: It seems manual version doesn't match with current version VRC Object Sync, there is just one parameter, and manual showed two parameters. Please update manual to match it with current version. You can add to manual VRC Object Sync is not needed if pickup must kept locally and not shared.",
